{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the following limit?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/c/e9ca2167f0212d8e5e5a1e42d3ae7b399498612b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin(3x)}{4x}\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/483193f76e7569e1d88d17bd8df3575196230b4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{4}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{4}{3}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\infty   \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1  \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"318\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the numerator and denominator both results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since any number multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/9021697a5d5f2053f36c36b81ccfd2de1c90ed3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{0} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />. This means that <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=L%27H%C3%B4pital%27s_Rule\" title=\"L&#39;Hôpital&#39;s Rule\">L'Hôpital's Rule</a> can be used:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/75375e341832bf3a91d94172da94a8ffd500f88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{aligned} \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin(3x)}{4x}  &amp;= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\sin(3x)]}{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[4x]} \\\\ &amp;= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{3\\cos(3x)}{4} \\\\ &amp;= \\dfrac{3\\cos(0)}{4} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{4}} \\end{aligned}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -100px\" width=\"241\" height=\"226\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392ffa3f02928c97b0164499d5c884ffb4a04396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{aligned} \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin(3x)}{4x}  &amp;= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\dfrac{\\sin(3x)}{3x} \\cdot \\dfrac{3}{4} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\left( \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin(3x)}{3x} \\right) \\cdot \\dfrac{3}{4} \\\\ &amp;= 1 \\cdot \\dfrac{3}{4} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{4}} \\end{aligned}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -91px\" width=\"259\" height=\"192\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2025 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Ca